<section class="mi-escrow-strip">
  <div class="mi-container">

    {# ── Header row ── #}
    <div class="mi-escrow-strip__head">
      <div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: var(--mi-fw-bold); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mi-color-success); margin-bottom: 8px;">Non-Custodial Escrow</div>
        <h2 class="mi-h2" style="margin: 0 0 10px;">Your crypto is held by code, not by us</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--mi-text-secondary); font-size: var(--mi-fs-md); max-width: 62ch; margin: 0;">
          Every escrow-protected order settles through independent, non-custodial escrow infrastructure.
          Funds sit in a smart contract neither party can touch, and release only on the rules you agreed to at checkout.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="flex-shrink: 0;">
        <a href="factory-updates/non-custodial-on-chain-escrow-asic-miners" class="mi-btn mi-btn--primary">How escrow works</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ── Partner cards ── #}
    <div class="mi-escrow-strip__grid">

      <div class="mi-escrow-partner">
        <div class="mi-escrow-partner__top">
          <span class="mi-escrow-partner__mark" style="background: var(--mi-color-primary-soft); color: var(--mi-color-primary);">Z</span>
          <div>
            <div class="mi-escrow-partner__name">ZenLand</div>
            <div class="mi-escrow-partner__domain">zen.land</div>
          </div>
          <span class="mi-escrow-partner__pill">Non-custodial</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mi-escrow-partner__desc">Independent non-custodial escrow for high-value crypto trades, with transparent on-chain state and clear, published dispute rules.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mi-escrow-partner">
        <div class="mi-escrow-partner__top">
          <span class="mi-escrow-partner__mark" style="background: var(--mi-color-warning-soft); color: var(--mi-color-warning);">B</span>
          <div>
            <div class="mi-escrow-partner__name">BitEscrow</div>
            <div class="mi-escrow-partner__domain">bitescrow</div>
          </div>
          <span class="mi-escrow-partner__pill">Non-custodial</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mi-escrow-partner__desc">Smart-contract escrow that commits the funds up front and releases only when the agreed delivery conditions are met. No human custody.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mi-escrow-partner">
        <div class="mi-escrow-partner__top">
          <span class="mi-escrow-partner__mark" style="background: var(--mi-color-success-soft); color: var(--mi-color-success);">T</span>
          <div>
            <div class="mi-escrow-partner__name">Trustless.work</div>
            <div class="mi-escrow-partner__domain">trustless.work</div>
          </div>
          <span class="mi-escrow-partner__pill">Non-custodial</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mi-escrow-partner__desc">Fully trustless settlement infrastructure. No middleman, no custody. The contract enforces every step on a fixed, public clock.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    {# ── Guarantee row ── #}
    <div class="mi-escrow-strip__guarantees">
      <div class="mi-escrow-guarantee">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        <div>
          <strong>We never custody funds</strong>
          <span>Escrowed crypto sits in a contract we cannot withdraw from, freeze, or move.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mi-escrow-guarantee">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        <div>
          <strong>20-day protection hold</strong>
          <span>Funds release to us only after the hold ends, or earlier if you confirm delivery.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mi-escrow-guarantee">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="1 4 1 10 7 10"/><path d="M3.51 15a9 9 0 1 0 2.13-9.36L1 10"/></svg>
        <div>
          <strong>Auto-refund on dispute</strong>
          <span>Open a dispute inside the window and unresolved funds return to your wallet automatically.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mi-escrow-guarantee">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        <div>
          <strong>Verifiable on-chain</strong>
          <span>Every escrow state, from funding to release, is public and independently checkable.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="color: var(--mi-text-muted); font-size: var(--mi-fs-xs); margin: var(--mi-sp-8) 0 0; text-align: center;">
      Escrow settlement is provided by independent third-party infrastructure. The Miner Island is never a custodian of escrowed funds. Available on orders above $5,000.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.mi-escrow-strip { background: var(--mi-bg-soft); border-top: 1px solid var(--mi-border-subtle); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mi-border-subtle); padding: var(--mi-sp-16) 0; }
.mi-escrow-strip__head { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--mi-sp-8); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: var(--mi-sp-10); }
.mi-escrow-strip__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--mi-sp-6); }
.mi-escrow-partner { background: var(--mi-bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--mi-border-subtle); border-radius: var(--mi-radius-lg); padding: var(--mi-sp-6); box-shadow: var(--mi-shadow-sm); transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, border-color .15s ease; }
.mi-escrow-partner:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--mi-border-defined); box-shadow: var(--mi-shadow-md); }
.mi-escrow-partner__top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.mi-escrow-partner__mark { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: var(--mi-radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: var(--mi-fw-extra); font-size: var(--mi-fs-lg); flex-shrink: 0; }
.mi-escrow-partner__name { font-weight: var(--mi-fw-bold); color: var(--mi-text-headline); font-size: var(--mi-fs-md); }
.mi-escrow-partner__domain { color: var(--mi-text-muted); font-size: var(--mi-fs-xs); }
.mi-escrow-partner__pill { margin-left: auto; font-size: 11px; font-weight: var(--mi-fw-bold); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--mi-color-success); background: var(--mi-color-success-soft); border-radius: var(--mi-radius-full); padding: 3px 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
.mi-escrow-partner__desc { margin: 0; color: var(--mi-text-body); font-size: var(--mi-fs-sm); line-height: var(--mi-lh-relaxed); }
.mi-escrow-strip__guarantees { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--mi-sp-6); margin-top: var(--mi-sp-10); padding-top: var(--mi-sp-8); border-top: 1px solid var(--mi-border-subtle); }
.mi-escrow-guarantee { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
.mi-escrow-guarantee svg { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; color: var(--mi-color-success); }
.mi-escrow-guarantee strong { display: block; color: var(--mi-text-headline); font-size: var(--mi-fs-sm); margin-bottom: 2px; }
.mi-escrow-guarantee span { color: var(--mi-text-secondary); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .mi-escrow-strip__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .mi-escrow-strip__guarantees { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .mi-escrow-strip__guarantees { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
